#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid "Image Mask for Divi 5"
msgstr "Bildmaske für Divi 5"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid "https://github.com/markusritschel/divi5-image-mask"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid ""
"An image mask for the Image module of the Divi 5 Visual Builder: cut the "
"image into one of Divi's mask shapes or into a custom SVG mask."
msgstr ""
"Eine Bildmaske für das Bild-Modul des Divi 5 Visual Builders: das Bild in "
"eine von Divis Maskenformen oder eine eigene SVG-Maske schneiden."

#. Author of the plugin
#: divi5-image-mask.php
msgid "Markus Ritschel"
msgstr ""

#: divi5-image-mask.php:72
msgid "Image Mask"
msgstr "Bildmaske"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:73
msgid "Mask Shape"
msgstr "Maskenform"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:74
msgid ""
"One of Divi's mask shapes, or Custom for an image of your own. With a Divi "
"shape the image stays visible where a Divi background would show through the "
"same mask."
msgstr ""
"Eine von Divis Maskenformen oder „Eigene“ für ein eigenes Bild. Bei einer "
"Divi-Form bleibt das Bild sichtbar, wo ein Divi-Hintergrund durch dieselbe "
"Maske scheint."

#: divi5-image-mask.php:75
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Eigene"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:76
msgid "Custom Mask"
msgstr "Eigene Maske"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:77
msgid "An SVG or PNG. The image stays visible where the mask is opaque."
msgstr "Ein SVG oder PNG. Das Bild bleibt sichtbar, wo die Maske deckend ist."

#: divi5-image-mask.php:78
msgid "Transform"
msgstr "Transformation"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:79
msgid "Flip Horizontal"
msgstr "Horizontal spiegeln"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:80
msgid "Flip Vertical"
msgstr "Vertikal spiegeln"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:81
msgid "Rotate 90°"
msgstr "Um 90° drehen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:82
msgid "Invert"
msgstr "Umkehren"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:83
msgid "Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "Seitenverhältnis"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:84
msgid "Landscape"
msgstr "Querformat"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:85
msgid "Square"
msgstr "Quadratisch"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:86
msgid "Portrait"
msgstr "Hochformat"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:87
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Größe"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:88
msgid "Stretch to Fill"
msgstr "Strecken"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:89
msgid "Cover"
msgstr "Füllen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:90
msgid "Fit"
msgstr "Einpassen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:91
msgid "Custom Size"
msgstr "Eigene Größe"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:92
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Breite"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:93
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Höhe"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:94
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Position"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:95
msgid "Center"
msgstr "Mitte"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:96
msgid "Top Left"
msgstr "Oben links"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:97
msgid "Top"
msgstr "Oben"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:98
msgid "Top Right"
msgstr "Oben rechts"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:99
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Rechts"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:100
msgid "Bottom Right"
msgstr "Unten rechts"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:101
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "Unten"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:102
msgid "Bottom Left"
msgstr "Unten links"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:103
msgid "Left"
msgstr "Links"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:104
msgid "Horizontal Offset"
msgstr "Horizontaler Versatz"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:105
msgid "Vertical Offset"
msgstr "Vertikaler Versatz"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:106
msgid "Outside Opacity"
msgstr "Deckkraft außerhalb"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:107
msgid ""
"How much of the image shows outside the shape: 0 % hides it, 100 % shows it "
"fully. For the whole image use Filters › Opacity."
msgstr ""
"Wie stark das Bild außerhalb der Form sichtbar ist: 0 % blendet es aus, 100 "
"% zeigt es ganz. Für das ganze Bild: Filter › Deckkraft."

#: divi5-image-mask.php:108
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "Animation"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:109
msgid ""
"Zoom In opens the mask from nothing, Zoom Out shrinks it from three times "
"its size onto the shape, both around its position. Available with Stretch to "
"Fill and Custom Size."
msgstr ""
"„Einzoomen“ zieht die Maske aus dem Nichts auf, „Auszoomen“ zieht sie von "
"dreifacher Größe auf die Form zusammen, beide um ihre Position. Verfügbar "
"bei „Strecken“ und „Eigene Größe“."

#: divi5-image-mask.php:110
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keine"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:111
msgid "Zoom In"
msgstr "Einzoomen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:112
msgid "Zoom Out"
msgstr "Auszoomen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:113
msgid "Animation Start"
msgstr "Start der Animation"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:114
msgid "On Page Load"
msgstr "Beim Laden der Seite"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:115
msgid "When Scrolled Into View"
msgstr "Beim Hineinscrollen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:116
msgid "Animation Duration"
msgstr "Animationsdauer"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:117
msgid "Animation Delay"
msgstr "Animationsverzögerung"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:118
msgid "Animation Speed Curve"
msgstr "Animationskurve"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:119
msgid "Ease"
msgstr "Ease"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:120
msgid "Ease-In-Out"
msgstr "Ease-In-Out"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:121
msgid "Ease-In"
msgstr "Ease-In"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:122
msgid "Ease-Out"
msgstr "Ease-Out"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:123
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "Linear"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:124
msgid "Animation Direction"
msgstr "Richtung der Animation"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:125
msgid ""
"Alternate plays every second run backwards. With an even number of plays the "
"animation ends where it started."
msgstr ""
"„Abwechselnd“ spielt jeden zweiten Durchlauf rückwärts. Bei einer geraden "
"Anzahl von Durchläufen endet die Animation dort, wo sie begonnen hat."

#: divi5-image-mask.php:126
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:127
msgid "Alternate"
msgstr "Abwechselnd"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:128
msgid "Number of Plays"
msgstr "Anzahl der Durchläufe"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:129
msgid "Loop Endlessly"
msgstr "Endlos wiederholen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:130
msgid "Replay When Scrolled Back Into View"
msgstr "Beim erneuten Hineinscrollen wiederholen"

#: divi5-image-mask.php:131
msgid ""
"Once the image has left the window completely, the mask returns to its start "
"and plays again on the way back."
msgstr ""
"Hat das Bild das Fenster ganz verlassen, kehrt die Maske an ihren Anfang "
"zurück und spielt beim Zurückscrollen erneut."
